					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-399147#post-1299658</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-399147/scp-897#post-1299658</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 07 Nov 2011 17:39:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Gene R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>634139</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Think of the implications.<br /> You throw this guy into a volcano. You die. The person next to you dies. The nearby village dies, one person at a time. It might take a while to kill the entire planet, but still.</p> <p>Side note: Tallinn was named so in 1919. It was called Reval before that. So, our hero can't be any older than 135 years.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
